still pretty happy about it.  I played this on nethack.alt.org and
this was my third ascension ever.

I think it was probably the luckiest game I've ever had in my entire
life too.  I used seven wishes during the game, but I had probably
another 5 in reserve just in case.  One of the wishes was for a
cockatrice corpse for Orcus.  I don't like monkeying with him.

I actually managed to extinct some things too.  I'd never done that
before (and it wasn't intentional)

